     2360        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2361        B-mark AT ROW 1 COL 11
     2362        b-sel AT ROW 1 COL 21
     2363        B-link AT ROW 1 COL 41
     2364        b-chg AT ROW 1 COL 51
     2365        B-print AT ROW 1 COL 89
     2366        B-sch AT ROW 1 COL 92
