     2373        sch-name AT ROW 3 COL 55 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     2374        sch-id AT ROW 3 COL 55 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     2375        BR-rkep-grp AT ROW 4 COL 1
