     2545   END.
     2546   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF BR-rkep-grp IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2547   DO:
     2548       RUN proc-value-changed IN THIS-PROCEDURE (
     2549                                               OUTPUT  v-grp-name
     2550                                             , output  v-rkep-grp-name
     2551                                             ).
     2552    DISPLAY
     2553    v-grp-name
     2554    v-rkep-grp-name
     2555    WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
